          "type": "feature",
          "name": "Blessing of the Forge",
          "description": "At the end of a Long Rest, touch one nonmagical suit of armor or Simple or Martial weapon. Until your next Long Rest or death, it is magical and grants +1 AC if armor, or +1 to attack and damage rolls if a weapon. Only one object can carry the blessing."
        },
        {
          "type": "feature",
          "name": "Bonus Proficiency",
          "description": "Gain proficiency with Heavy Armor and Smith's Tools.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "armor_proficiency",
              "tags": [
                "heavy"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tool_proficiency",
              "tags": [
                "Smith's Tools"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "feature",
          "name": "Channel Divinity: Artisan's Blessing",
          "description": "Expend Channel Divinity during a 1-hour ritual to transform metal worth up to 100 gp into one nonmagical item containing metal. The supplied metal must equal the item's value; you can duplicate a metal-bearing item such as a key while holding the original."
        }
      ]
    },
